365:      * The returned Vector implicitly starts at the root (the model)
366:      * and follows element's chain of owning namespaces back down to
367:      * element. The first element will thus be the name of the top level
368:      * namespace below the model, and the last element will be the name
369:      * of element itself. Note thus that for the model the path will be
