396:      * This function may fail and return null eg if some required object
397:      * doesn't exist in the target model and cannot be copied.
398:      *
399:      * @param elem is some element.
400:      * @param model is the model the returned object shall belong to.
401:      * @return An element of the same type and at the same position in the
402:      *  model as elem, or if that would turn out impossible then null.
