1183: /**
1184:  * A map containing instances of meta-classes (modelelements) as keys and 
1185:  * EventListenerLists as values. The class is a wrapper around an underlying
1186:  * java.util.HashMap and provides some custom methods for easy access to the 
1187:  * underlying data structure.
