2299:      * injector which is part of the Dresden OCL Toolkit and are in
2300:      * detail:
2301:      *
2302:      * &nbsp;@invariant for each invariant specified
2303:      * &nbsp;@precondition for each precondition specified
2304:      * &nbsp;@postcondition for each postcondition specified
2305:      * &nbsp;@key-type specifying the class of the keys of a mapped association
2306:      * &nbsp; Currently mapped associations are not supported yet...
2307:      * &nbsp;@element-type specifying the class referenced in an association
2308:      *
2309:      * @since 2001-09-26 ArgoUML 0.9.3
2310:      * @author Steffen Zschaler
