446:      * @param agg1 The aggregation type of the second Associaton end
447:      * @param c2 The second classifier to connect to
448:      * @param nav2 The navigability of the second Associaton end
449:      * @param agg2 The aggregation type of the second Associaton end
450:      * @return MAssociation
451:      * @throws IllegalArgumentException if either Classifier is null
452:      */
453:     private MAssociation buildAssociation(MClassifier c1,
454: 					 boolean nav1,
455: 					 MAggregationKind agg1,
456: 					 MClassifier c2,
