103:     /**
104:      * Adds a listener that listens to all modelevents that are named eventNames
105:      * and that occur to instances of a given modelClass.
106:      *
107:      * <p>
108:      * If you want the listener to be registred for remove events (that is: an
109:      * instance of the class the listener is listening too is removed), then you
110:      * have to register for the eventname "remove"
111:      * </p>
112:      * @param listener
113:      * @param modelClass
114:      * @param eventNames
