1078:     /**
1079:      * Moves some object to trash. 
1080:      *
1081:      * TODO: This mechanism must be rethought since it only deletes an
1082:      * object completely from the project
1083:      *
1084:      * @param obj The object to be deleted
1085:      * @see org.argouml.kernel.Project#trashInternal(Object)
1086:      */
1087:     // Attention: whole Trash mechanism should be rethought concerning nsuml
1088:     public void moveToTrash(Object obj) {
