41: /** "Abstract" base class for design critics.  Each subclass should define
42:  *  its own predicate method and define its own relevance tags. <p>
43:  *
44:  *  Steps to follow when adding a critic are listed in the Argo
45:  *  cookbook under <A HREF="../cookbook.html#define_critic">
46:  *  define_critic</a>. */
47: 
48: public class Critic implements Poster, java.io.Serializable {
